<!-- pages/checkup/checkup.wxml -->
<!-- 合规体检工具：免费信息工具，不涉及交易 -->
<view class="checkup-page">

  <!-- 步骤指示器 -->
  <view class="stepper">
    <view class="step {{step >= 0 ? 'step--active' : ''}}">1.企业信息</view>
    <view class="step-line {{step >= 1 ? 'step-line--active' : ''}}"></view>
    <view class="step {{step >= 1 ? 'step--active' : ''}}">2.体检答题</view>
    <view class="step-line {{step >= 2 ? 'step-line--active' : ''}}"></view>
    <view class="step {{step >= 2 ? 'step--active' : ''}}">3.体检报告</view>
  </view>

  <!-- Step 0: 企业信息 -->
  <view wx:if="{{step === 0}}" class="form-section">
    <view class="form-hint">填写企业基本信息，生成专属体检报告</view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">企业名称</text>
      <input class="form-input" placeholder="如：XX酒店管理有限公司" value="{{form.companyName}}" data-field="companyName" bindinput="onFormInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">所属行业</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{industries}}" bindchange="onIndustryChange">
        <view class="form-picker {{form.industry ? '' : 'form-picker--placeholder'}}">
          {{form.industry || '请选择行业'}}
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">员工人数（选填）</text>
      <input class="form-input" type="number" placeholder="如：50" value="{{form.employeeCount}}" data-field="employeeCount" bindinput="onFormInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">月均营收 USD（选填）</text>
      <input class="form-input" type="digit" placeholder="如：20000" value="{{form.monthlyRevenue}}" data-field="monthlyRevenue" bindinput="onFormInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item form-item--switch">
      <text class="form-label">已注册增值税</text>
      <switch checked="{{form.hasVatRegistration}}" data-field="hasVatRegistration" bindchange="onSwitchChange" color="#B8860B" />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item form-item--switch">
      <text class="form-label">有外籍员工</text>
      <switch checked="{{form.hasForeignEmployees}}" data-field="hasForeignEmployees" bindchange="onSwitchChange" color="#B8860B" />
    </view>

    <button class="btn-primary" data-step="1" bindtap="goToStep">开始体检</button>
  </view>

  <!-- Step 1: 答题 -->
  <view wx:if="{{step === 1}}" class="quiz-section">
    <view class="quiz-progress">
      <text class="quiz-progress__text">{{currentQ + 1}} / {{questions.length}}</text>
      <view class="quiz-progress__bar">
        <view class="quiz-progress__fill" style="width: {{(currentQ + 1) / questions.length * 100}}%"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="quiz-card">
      <view class="quiz-card__title">{{questions[currentQ].title}}</view>
      <view class="quiz-card__desc">{{questions[currentQ].desc}}</view>

      <view class="quiz-options">
        <view
          wx:for="{{questions[currentQ].options}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="quiz-option {{answers[questions[currentQ].id] === index ? 'quiz-option--selected' : ''}}"
          data-qid="{{questions[currentQ].id}}"
          data-idx="{{index}}"
          bindtap="onAnswerSelect"
        >
          <text>{{item}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{currentQ > 0}}" class="quiz-prev" bindtap="prevQuestion">上一题</view>
  </view>

  <!-- Step 2: 报告 -->
  <view wx:if="{{step === 2 && report}}" class="report-section">
    <view class="report-header" style="border-color: {{report.gradeColor}};">
      <view class="report-grade" style="color: {{report.gradeColor}};">{{report.grade}}</view>
      <view class="report-score">
        <text class="report-score__num">{{report.score}}</text>
        <text class="report-score__unit">分</text>
      </view>
      <view class="report-company">{{report.companyName}}</view>
      <view class="report-date">{{report.date}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="report-summary">
      <view class="report-summary__title">总体评估</view>
      <view class="report-summary__text">{{report.summary}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{report.issues.length > 0}}" class="report-issues">
      <view class="report-section__title">风险项 ({{report.issues.length}})</view>
      <view wx:for="{{report.issues}}" wx:key="title" class="issue-item">
        <view class="issue-item__header">
          <text class="issue-item__title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="issue-tag issue-tag--{{item.level}}">{{item.label}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="issue-item__desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{report.recommendations.length > 0}}" class="report-recs">
      <view class="report-section__title">改善建议</view>
      <view wx:for="{{report.recommendations}}" wx:key="title" class="rec-item">
        <text class="rec-item__text">{{item.title}}：{{item.action}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 合规操作区：复制报告 + 获取专业解读 -->
    <view class="report-actions">
      <button class="btn-outline" bindtap="onCopyReport">复制报告</button>
      <contact-bar
        text="获取专业解读"
        source="checkup_report"
        type="primary"
        params="{{'score=' + report.score + '&grade=' + report.grade + '&company=' + report.companyName}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="report-footer">
      <text class="report-footer__text">本报告基于公开税务法规生成，仅供参考。如需详细合规方案，请咨询专业顾问。</text>
      <text class="report-footer__restart" bindtap="onRestart">重新体检</text>
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
